        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu nabo Aburaam tema, “Okoe, Ekapolon kaŋ, nyiŋo ca! Kimyekinae erwor; ani bo kerae ŋatomoniuni bon iryamuni iyoŋ iyookino a nen?” Toboŋok Ekapolon tema, “Nyamunyari ayoŋ akibois ŋin erae karyamu ŋatomoniuni ŋulu iyookino a nen.” ",
