        {
          "text": "Tolimu nai Aburaam tema, “Okoe Ekapolon kaŋ, nyiŋo ca! Kimyekinae olimu apei ca bon; ani bo kerae ŋitomon bon iryamuni iyoŋ iyookino a nen?” Toboŋok Ekapolon tema, “Aŋuna a ŋulutomon a ŋul, nyamunyari ayoŋ akibois ŋin.” ",
